    <!--
      "SR" monogram, built as a simple blocky/pixel-style glyph (a 5x7 dot-
      matrix-style grid per letter, each "on" cell a 4x4 unit square) rather
      than smooth font curves — this stays crisp and legible at small
      launcher-icon sizes in a way that thin curved letterforms often don't.
      S occupies grid columns at x=32..52, R at x=56..76, both y=44..72.
    -->
